Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add posture-report explanation layer and POST
 /v1/posture/explain

One checked sentence per measured posture row for beAIve reports. Strict request
(no identifiers), refuses positions that contradict their numbers, deterministic
template narrator plus consistency guard and banned-phrase list; an injected model
narrator is supported but not wired.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
